  "description": "- Infill the ground and first floor side recess to extend the internal footprint.\n- Convert the existing loft into habitable accommodation, including a new rear dormer to provide a bedroom and shower room, along with four new roof windows (three to the front and one to the rear).\n- Alter the rear roof profile from hip to gable to incorporate a new window and create an enclosed loft storage area.\n- Reconfigure the existing first floor flat to suit the revised internal layout.\n- Enlarge the existing rear openings to install two new sliding doors—one at ground floor and one at first floor.\n- Internal alterations\n",
